# Decluttarr-specific, NON-SECRET config. This file IS committed.
#
# Shared values (PUID/PGID/TZ/CONFIG_ROOT/DATA_ROOT) live in ../../common.env.
#
# SONARR_API_KEY / RADARR_API_KEY / QBITTORRENT_USERNAME /
# QBITTORRENT_PASSWORD are Komodo secret Variables, set in
# komodo/resources/stacks.toml's `environment` block, not here. They are read
# by the `!ENV` tags in configs/config.yaml, not by decluttarr's own env
# parsing.
#
# Everything else decluttarr does is configured in configs/config.yaml. V2 no
# longer takes instances or download clients from the environment.

# Nothing else decluttarr-specific needed yet.
